  {
   "id": "2026-10-03-a7d4ce",
   "date": "2026-10-02T16:31:40.000Z",
   "title": "Chongqing, China",
   "text": "Aymon touched down on a beautiful Chongqing day. We really saw the multilayered nature of the city though it’s hard to capture in photos. No one knows where the real ground is.\n\nSaw the biggest crane ever and it was on a boat! \n\nAre some mysterious street goop, not bad.\n\nThe wholesale shops here are insane. This glasses one went on a long way with different shops.",
